    "sentence_translations": [
      "(15) Big Sister Likes Her",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo saw a cute thing under the table.",
      "",
      "Cola?! That’s Cola!! Qian Duoduo wanted to cry again.",
      "",
      "“Big sister, you like this little dog, right?” her little brother asked.",
      "",
      "“You … you knew? You knew I liked this dog?”",
      "",
      "“Me and Dad saw it. You and this little dog were playing at the pet store. Dad said that he also saw it before.",
      "You like going there. You like playing with this little dog,” her little brother said.",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo looked at Uncle Xie. Uncle Xie didn’t say anything.  Uncle Xie was smiling.",
      "",
      "Her little brother said, “Do you like this little dog? Do you like her?”",
      "",
      "“I do! Her name is Cola,” Qian Duoduo said.",
      "",
      "“Great! Big sister likes her! Big sister likes her!” her little brother said."
    ]
